**Preview:** <%= link_to "Browse Animations", "/lookbook/inspect/animations/fade-in" %>
## Architecture
**Component Organization:**
```
app/components/
├── ui/              # Base elements
├── card/            # Content cards
├── terminal/        # Terminal UI
├── layout/          # Page structure
├── animations/      # Entrance effects
├── blog/            # Blog-specific
├── github/          # GitHub widgets
├── hero/            # Hero sections
├── navigation/      # Nav elements
└── skills/          # Skills display
```
**Preview Organization:**
```
spec/components/
├── previews/        # Lookbook previews
└── docs/            # This documentation
```
## Design Tokens
Consistent values defined in `TokyoNightTokens` concern:
**Colors:** `COLORS[:blue]`, `COLORS[:fg]`, `COLORS[:bg]`
**Shadows:** `SHADOWS[:sm]`, `SHADOWS[:glow_blue]`
**Gradients:** `GRADIENTS[:rainbow]`, `GRADIENTS[:border]`
**CSS Variables:**
- `--tokyo-blue`, `--tokyo-purple`, etc.
- `--font-code` (Fira Code)
- `--transition-base`, `--transition-slow`
## Usage Example
```
<%%= render Layout::ContainerComponent.new do %>
  <%%= render Animations::SlideUpComponent.new(delay: 100) do %>
    <%%= render Card::BaseComponent.new do %>
      <h2 class="text-[#7aa2f7]">Component Composition</h2>
      <%%= render UI::BadgeComponent.new(variant: :skill) do %>
        ViewComponent
        <%% end %>
        <%% end %>
        <%% end %>
        <%% end %>
        ```
